artifacts/reproducibility/

# ===== ReEval-2 (held-out study) =====
# The released files live in data/reeval2/ (lower case). The working copies the
# scripts write (data/ReEval2/sample/ with the conversation payloads, and the
# rehearsal pool in data/ReEval2/ensayo/) stay private. On a case-insensitive file
# system (macOS default, core.ignorecase=true) data/ReEval2/ and data/reeval2/ are
# the same directory, so the released directory is re-included and only the
# private subdirectories are ignored there.
data/ReEval2/
!data/reeval2/
data/reeval2/sample/
data/reeval2/ensayo/
